  "description": "Commercial transistor Octavia reconstruction using the 13 February 2019 Roger Mayer Octavia redraw, cross-checked against the L. A. Holt version described by Swell Amps. The three MPSA13 Darlingtons are represented by pairs of silicon junction transistors with assumed individual gain 100 and a 2.2 MΩ interstage-emitter leakage path. The collector and emitter of Q3 drive opposite half-cycles through separate silicon rectifiers. The input uses the 2N3906 and the 10 kΩ reverse-audio Drive control. The supply is an ideal 9 V battery.",
  "groundNode": "0",
  "inputNode": "in",
  "layout": {
    "pots": [
      "Drive",
      "Volume"
    ]
  },
  "name": "Roger Mayer Octavia Transistor",
  "outputNode": "out",
  "version": 3,
